## Migration guide — z webapp-cicd-templates na webapp-ci-cd-workflows

Jeśli projekt aktualnie używa webapp-cicd-templates i potrzebuje upgrade do audit-ready:

### Krok 1 — Backup starych workflows

```bash
mkdir -p .github/workflows/_legacy
cp .github/workflows/ci.yml .github/workflows/_legacy/ci.yml.coolify
cp .github/workflows/deploy.yml .github/workflows/_legacy/deploy.yml.coolify
```

### Krok 2 — Kopiuj nowe templates

```bash
cp library/skills/webapp/webapp-ci-cd-workflows/templates/ci.yml.template .github/workflows/ci.yml
cp library/skills/webapp/webapp-ci-cd-workflows/templates/cd.yml.template .github/workflows/cd.yml
cp library/skills/webapp/webapp-ci-cd-workflows/templates/security.yml.template .github/workflows/security.yml
cp library/skills/webapp/webapp-ci-cd-workflows/templates/dependabot.yml.template .github/dependabot.yml
cp library/skills/webapp/webapp-ci-cd-workflows/templates/codeql-config.yml.template .github/codeql/codeql-config.yml
```

### Krok 3 — sed-replace zmiennych (patrz SKILL.md sekcja 6)

```bash
# Wartości spójne z webapp-docker-templates w projekcie
sed -i \
  -e "s/{{PROJECT_NAME}}/{{PROJECT_NAME}}/g" \
  -e "s/{{GHCR_OWNER}}/logicmorrow/g" \
  ... (pełna lista w SKILL.md sekcja 6 krok 2)
```

### Krok 4 — Zarejestruj self-hosted runner na VPS prod

Patrz SKILL.md sekcja 6 krok 4.

### Krok 5 — Weryfikacja różnic CI

| Stare (webapp-cicd-templates) | Nowe (webapp-ci-cd-workflows) |
|---|---|
| lint + typecheck + test | lint + typecheck + unit-test + e2e-test + docker-build |
| coverage: konfigurowalny | coverage gate ≥80% enforced |
| brak e2e | playwright e2e job |
| brak docker-build | docker-build (no push) w CI |

### Krok 6 — Usuń stary deploy.yml (Coolify/ssh-compose)

```bash
rm .github/workflows/_legacy/deploy.yml.coolify  # jeśli nie potrzebujesz jako reference
```

### Krok 7 — Commit

```bash
git add .github/
git commit -m "ci: upgrade webapp-cicd-templates → webapp-ci-cd-workflows (audit-ready)"
git push
```

